{"id":881273,"title":"24｜自媒体提效案例：感受提示词的魅力","content":"本课讲解了如何搭建文案润色智能体，重点介绍了大模型的工作原理及提示词的重要性。通过创建一个聊天助手类应用，展示了从系统消息到用户消息的处理流程。强调了提示词在定义助手角色、工作背景、步骤和输出格式中的作用。课程对比了新手与专家编写的提示词，说明了结构化提示词（如使用Markdown格式）对于提高文案质量的关键性。具体案例中，通过优化留学咨询文案，展示了不同层次提示词的效果差异。此外，还解释了多轮对话中上下文管理机制，即通过携带几轮对话内容确保连续性。最终总结指出，编写高效提示词不仅依赖于技术理解，更需深刻洞察业务需求。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":404782,"user_name":"R  Y","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1132961,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"202E41373BF270","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/11/49/a1/33444d91.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1768639570,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101048201,"comment_content":"老师，应该把提示词文档发出来吧？","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":401933,"user_name":"Gamehu","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1013894,"ip_address":"四川","ucode":"C494BA1A00ADBA","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/78/86/d5019bb0.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1754575274,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101048201,"comment_content":"你好 问下我用线上的dify搭建工作流，用到代码节点，代码里python三方包怎么安装","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":401319,"user_name":"Geek_ooL","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1665669,"ip_address":"浙江","ucode":"B651D25C684BD2","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/19/6a/85/f0cdcda8.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1751648351,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101048201,"comment_content":"可以发一下提示词的文档吗，老师","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":400689,"user_name":"yan","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1169015,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"3C4DA2C32D159F","user_header":"http://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/AkI7IRfKPvpz2nibGDV0iaGD9wGmAcNN0jNcl2H9LGicIalV6kK1FjQiagAoiazM0IAY4d1ic7a6fasGBvsPXgSlJ1xg/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_cti